<p>Thanks to everyone in the chat and the forums who reviewed this.</p>
<p>I purposely wrote this so that people could have multiple interpretations of what's actually going on, but if anyone wants to read my personal, in-no-way-authoritative, interpretation, here it is.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
