<p>Both of them are crazy. God Enki is a reality bender who accidentally convinced himself he was a god, and Alien Enki is a recruitment tool created by a ancient-aliens-themed cult. &quot;Ea&quot;, the writer of the note at the end, could be another reality warper or the actual deity.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Also, DreamwalkerFae, one of the people who reviewed my draft in the chat, came up with an extremely cool interpretation.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
